# New project structure

When they ask to create or scaffold a project:

1. Use their path, or `04_Projects/<project-name>/`:

```
<project-name>/
├── meetings/
├── prototype/
├── requirements/
├── background/
├── decisions/
└── assets/
```

2. Optional README in each folder — copy wording from `99_System/templates/project/`.

3. Do not create `roadmap/` or `output/` unless they ask.

## Friction

Append clumsiness to `99_System/improvement/friction-log.md` without asking.
